Package: ggplotpq
Title: 'ggplot2' Visualisation Helpers for 'phyloseq' Objects
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Adrien", "Taudière", , "adrien.taudiere@zaclys.net", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1088-1182"))
Description: A 'ggplot2'-based visualisation layer for 'phyloseq' objects
    within the 'pqverse' ecosystem. Provides pure-ggplot2 helpers
    (geoms, themes, scales, color/palette management) and single-phyloseq
    ggplot wrappers migrated from 'MiscMetabar' and 'comparpq'. Pure
    rendering only: analysis methods that produce a plot as a side-effect
    belong in 'netaipq'; cross-package comparators belong in 'comparpq'.
License: AGPL-3
